        "bc4_unorm_rrrr [a.k.a. DXT5A] (Compressed Intensity replicated to ARGB){bc4_unorm_000r [a.k.a. DXT5A] (Compressed Intensity replicated to ARGB)}",
        "Compressed Monochrome + Alpha",
